      "content": {
        "text": "Let’s unpack the exact clue.\n\nSimplify 4000 : 6000 before splitting the profit.\n\n4000 : 6000 = 2 : 3. A gets 2/(2+3) of ₹2,500 = ₹1,000. Choosing ₹1,500 gives B's share, not A's.\n\nNow use the same idea on fresh numbers.",
