    "retry_remedy_1": {
      "id": "retry_remedy_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let’s work this parallel case through.\n\n7500 : 4500 = 5 : 3. P's share = 5/8 × ₹3,200 = ₹2,000.\n\nTry it once more. This time focus on the same relationship, not the surface story.",
